cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite it using the metadata below, together with the associated article once published."
title: "Code and data for: Reassessing prehistoric fish consumption in Southern Brazil through compound specific stable isotope analysis of amino acids"
type: software
abstract: "R code and data to reproduce the analyses and figures in the article, including bulk collagen and compound-specific amino acid isotope data (delta13C, delta15N, delta34S) for human and faunal samples from sambaquis in southern Brazil, the MixSIAR Bayesian mixing model, and trophic position estimates."
keywords:
  - Brazil
  - shell mounds
  - sambaquis
  - stable isotopes
  - compound specific
  - amino acids
repository-code: "https://github.com/OlCraig-arch/reassessing-fish-consumption"
version: "1.0.0"
